<title>UK: Forth Ports wins Edinburgh planning permit.</title>
<headline>Forth Ports wins Edinburgh planning permit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forth Ports said on Wednesday it won the outline planning permission from the Edinburgh council for building the &quot;Ocean Terminal&quot; within Scotland's east coast Port of Leith.</p>
<p>The development will include a cruise liner terminal, shops, offices, hotels and appartments, Forth Ports said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
